# spec: when the [1.15] write fails with ANC off, set_cnc_presets still writes the step back and switches ANC off again before it reports the device error.
# source: hardware report on firmware 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590: a 3-byte [1.15] SETGET answered ERROR 01 Length. Synthetic: an error after ANC was switched on, following the [1.5] layout.
device nc700
call set_cnc_presets 0 5 10
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 02 00
send 01 05 02 02 02 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 01
send 01 0f 02 04 00 00 05 0a
recv 01 0f 04 01 06
send 01 05 02 02 02 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 02 01
send 01 05 02 02 02 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 02 00
result err device-error 6
